<title>FRANCE: ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S WORLD CUP DOWNHILL TRAINING TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S WORLD CUP DOWNHILL TRAINING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>CHAMONIX, France 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times in a men's</p>
<p>World Cup Alpine skiing downhill training run on Thursday:</p>
<p>1. Adrien Duvillard (France) Two minutes 03.95 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Luc Alphand (France)		    1.19 behind</p>
<p> 3. Ales Brezavsek (Slovenia)	     1.36</p>
<p> 4 equal. Hermann Maier (Austria)	 1.47</p>
<p> 4 equal. Luca Cattaneo (Italy)	   1.47</p>
<p> 6. Norbert Holzknecht (Austria)	  1.52</p>
<p> 7. Bruno Kernen (Switzerland)	    1.54</p>
<p> 8. Werner Franz (Austria)		  1.66</p>
<p> 9. Atle Skaardal (Norway)		  1.87</p>
<p> 10. Andreas Schifferer (Austria)	 2.12</p>
</text>
